1,Daai Chin - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daai_Chin,"The Daai-Chin are of Tibeto-Burman descent. They primarily live in Mindat, Paletwa, Matupi, and Kanpetlet townships of southern Chin State. With more than 180 villages and a population estimated between 35,000 and 45,000, the Daai-Chin represent the majority ethnic group in the Southern Chin Hills.","Chin, Daai",Sino-Tibetan
